sequenceDiagram
    participant User as Usuario
    participant WhatsApp as WhatsApp (Meta)
    participant Webhook as /api/webhook
    participant Dataverse as Dataverse
    participant App as FastAPI Service
    participant WhatsAppSvc as WhatsAppClient
    participant MockDataverse as MockDataverseClient

    User->>WhatsApp: Mensaje entrante
    WhatsApp->>Webhook: POST webhook (payload)
    Webhook->>App: Validate & parse
    App->>Dataverse: save_message (via DataverseClient)
    alt ENVIRONMENT == LOCAL
        App->>MockDataverse: save_message (in-memory)
        MockDataverse-->>App: saved (id)
    else ENVIRONMENT == PROD
        App->>Dataverse: acquire_token (MSAL) and POST to Dataverse Web API
        Dataverse-->>App: 201 / saved
    end
    App->>WhatsAppSvc: send auto-reply (optional)
    WhatsAppSvc->>WhatsApp: POST messages (Graph API)
    WhatsApp-->>App: 200 OK
    Note right of App: Dashboard queries
    App->>Dataverse: query_conversations / query_messages
    Dataverse-->>App: conversations / messages
    App-->>User Browser: dashboard rendering
